### ==================================================================
### 2. USER SERVICE - Profil kandydata
### ==================================================================

### KROK 7: Mój profil (kandydat)
# 💡 Skopiuj "id" do @candidateId
GET {{GatewayUrl}}/user/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{candidateToken}}

<> 2026-10-07T184619.404.json

###

### KROK 8: Uzupełnienie profilu - onboarding (kandydat)
PUT {{GatewayUrl}}/user/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{candidateToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstname": "Kacper",
  "lastname": "Dev",
  "phone": "+48123456789",
  "city": "Warszawa",
  "stack": ["C#", ".NET", "PostgreSQL", "Docker"],
  "experience": 2
}

<> 2026-10-07T184630.200.json
<> 2026-10-07T184356.200.json

###

### KROK 9: Walidacja - za długie imię i zły enum (oczekiwane 400)
PUT {{GatewayUrl}}/user/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{candidateToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstname": "AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA",
  "lastname": "Dev",
  "experience": 99
}

###

### KROK 10: Lista kandydatów (rekruter)
GET {{GatewayUrl}}/user/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{recruiterToken}}

<> 2026-10-07T184637.200.json
<> 2026-10-07T184519.200.json
<> 2026-10-07T184402.200.json
<> 2026-10-07T184346.200.json

###

### KROK 11: Profil kandydata po ID (rekruter)
GET {{GatewayUrl}}/user/api/users/{{candidateId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{recruiterToken}}

###

### KROK 12: Kandydat próbuje pobrać listę (oczekiwane 403)
GET {{GatewayUrl}}/user/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{candidateToken}}

###

### KROK 13: Bez tokena (oczekiwane 401)
GET {{GatewayUrl}}/user/api/users/me

###

### KROK 14: Endpoint internal NIE jest dostępny przez gateway (oczekiwane 404)
POST {{GatewayUrl}}/user/internal/users/{{candidateId}}
X-Api-Key: dev-internal-key-change-me


### ==================================================================
### 3. OFFER SERVICE - Działania na ofertach
### ==================================================================

### KROK 15: Tworzenie nowej oferty (rekruter)
# 💡 Skopiuj "id" utworzonej oferty do @createdOfferId
POST {{GatewayUrl}}/offer/offers
Authorization: Bearer {{recruiterToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Senior .NET Core Developer",
  "description": "Poszukujemy doświadczonego programisty .NET do rozwoju mikroserwisów i architektury YARP.",
  "salary": 18000,
  "category": 0,
  "experience": 2,
  "stack": ["C#", ".NET 10", "PostgreSQL", "Docker", "YARP"],
  "startDate": "2026-11-01T00:00:00Z",
  "endDate": "2026-12-01T00:00:00Z",
  "company": "Tech Corp Sp. z o.o."
}

<> 2026-10-07T184427.201.json

###

### KROK 16: Wszystkie aktywne oferty z filtrami (publiczne)
GET {{GatewayUrl}}/offer/offers?searchTerm=Developer&category=0&minSalary=5000&limit=10

<> 2026-10-07T184439.200.json
<> 2026-10-07T184432.200.json

###

### KROK 17: Pojedyncza oferta po ID (publiczne)
GET {{GatewayUrl}}/offer/offers/{{createdOfferId}}

<> 2026-10-07T184434.404.txt

###

### KROK 18: Edycja oferty (rekruter, autor)
PUT {{GatewayUrl}}/offer/offers/{{createdOfferId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{recruiterToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Lead .NET Core Developer",
  "description": "Zaktualizowany opis — poszukiwany Team Lead z doświadczeniem w mikroserwisach.",
  "salary": 22000,
  "category": 0,
  "experience": 3,
  "stack": ["C#", ".NET 10", "YARP", "PostgreSQL", "Docker"],
  "startDate": "2026-11-01T00:00:00Z",
  "endDate": "2026-12-15T00:00:00Z",
  "company": "Tech Corp Global"
}

###

### KROK 19: Kandydat próbuje utworzyć ofertę (oczekiwane 403)
POST {{GatewayUrl}}/offer/offers
Authorization: Bearer {{candidateToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Fake offer",
  "description": "Nie powinno przejść.",
  "salary": 1000,
  "category": 0,
  "experience": 0,
  "stack": ["C#"],
  "startDate": "2026-11-01T00:00:00Z",
  "endDate": "2026-12-01T00:00:00Z",
  "company": "Nobody"
}

###

### KROK 20: Usunięcie oferty (rekruter, autor)
DELETE {{GatewayUrl}}/offer/offers/{{createdOfferId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{recruiterToken}}


### ==================================================================
### 4. CV + RECRUITMENT - Aplikacja i ocena AI
### ==================================================================
# Wymaga LM Studio na porcie 1234. Ocena działa w tle: aplikacja -> parsowanie CV -> ocena AI -> wynik.
@cvId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@applicationId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### KROK 21: Upload CV (kandydat, tylko PDF jest parsowany przez AI)
POST {{GatewayUrl}}/user/api/users/me/cvs
Authorization: Bearer {{candidateToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="CV.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./CV.pdf
--boundary--

###

### KROK 22: Lista moich CV (kandydat) - skopiuj "id" do @cvId
GET {{GatewayUrl}}/user/api/users/me/cvs
Authorization: Bearer {{candidateToken}}

###

### KROK 23: Aplikowanie na ofertę (kandydat) - skopiuj "id" do @applicationId
POST {{GatewayUrl}}/recruitment/api/applications
Authorization: Bearer {{candidateToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "offerId": "{{createdOfferId}}",
  "cvId": "{{cvId}}",
  "coverLetter": "Chętnie dołączę do zespołu."
}

###

### KROK 24: Ranking aplikacji na ofertę wg AI score (rekruter)
# aiStatus: Pending -> Processing -> Completed | Failed; breakdown = ocena każdego wymagania
GET {{GatewayUrl}}/recruitment/api/offers/{{createdOfferId}}/applications
Authorization: Bearer {{recruiterToken}}

###

### KROK 25: Ponowna ocena AI (rekruter, np. po edycji wymagań oferty) - oczekiwane 202
POST {{GatewayUrl}}/recruitment/api/applications/{{applicationId}}/ai-evaluation
Authorization: Bearer {{recruiterToken}}
